# The Hermes image builds from the repo root (images/hermes/Dockerfile): it
# carries the fragment CLI, of the root workspace. Its context is only what
# its build reads; everything else (targets, the cell's builds, node_modules,
# git) stays out. The stub image builds from images/ (images/.dockerignore).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!cli
!crates
!templates
!xtask
!images
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/.wrangler
